{"kind":"finding","date":"2026-11-26","surface":"phone","area":"phone/tracker-services-1","proof":"code-read","needs_him":false,"verified":"pending","status":"open","id":"FN-B-words-phone-tracker-services-1-01","lens":"10","refs":["F-phone-533","F-phone-512","F-phone-505"],"severity":"S4","title":"The same record goes by two or three names across the workout, the exercise page and the finish screen","what":"For a timed hold like a plank, the pop-up during the workout calls the record 'Longest time', the exercise page tile calls it 'Longest hold' and the chart calls it 'Best time'. The strongest-set record is 'Strongest set (est. 1-rep max)' in the pop-up but 'Estimated 1-rep max' on the chart, with a short form the app's own word rules avoid. The biggest single set is 'Most lifted in one set' in the pop-up and 'Kg lifted in best set' on the chart. On the finish screen the big number says 'more than previous' while the note of facts under it says 'than your last push workout'. A member cannot tell these are the same thing.","expected":"One name for each record and each comparison, used the same way in the pop-up, the exercise page, the chart and the finish screen, with no short forms.","evidence":["apps/mobile/src/tracker/services/liveRecords.ts:283-290","apps/mobile/src/tracker/services/exerciseStats.ts:220-228","apps/mobile/src/tracker/services/exerciseChart.ts:129-147","apps/mobile/src/tracker/services/kgHero.ts:88-96","apps/mobile/src/tracker/services/coachNote.ts:104-112"],"root_cause_key":"record-names-differ-per-screen","who":"members","how_often":"every workout with a new record","fix_line":"Pick one name for each record and comparison and use it on every screen","fix_size":"small"}
{"kind":"finding","date":"2026-11-26","surface":"phone","area":"phone/tracker-services-1","proof":"code-read","needs_him":false,"verified":"pending","status":"open","id":"FN-B-words-phone-tracker-services-1-02","lens":"gap-10","refs":["F-phone-509","P-A7-phone-watch-3-23"],"severity":"S3","title":"Bringing in Hevy or Strong workouts promises routines, but a member with few repeated workouts gets none and no word why","what":"Before the file is picked, the import screen says that after the workouts come in the app builds routines from the workouts repeated most (for Strong it adds that Strong does not export routines). The app only builds a routine from a workout done at least 3 times. When nothing reaches that, the result screen just shows 'See your workouts' and 'Done': no routines, and no line saying none could be built or how to make one. A new member who moved from Hevy with a short history is left looking for routines the screen promised.","expected":"The promise says routines come from workouts done at least 3 times, and the result screen says plainly when none could be built and offers to make a routine.","evidence":["apps/mobile/src/tracker/services/importFlowWords.ts:42-47","apps/mobile/src/app/import/index.tsx:591","apps/mobile/src/app/import/index.tsx:890-902","apps/mobile/src/tracker/services/routineRebuild.ts:83"],"root_cause_key":"import-routines-promise-no-fallback","who":"new members moving from Hevy or Strong","how_often":"every import with few repeated workouts","fix_line":"Say the 3-times rule up front and tell the member when no routine was built","fix_size":"small"}
